{"seq":3,"slug":"modern-cnn-designs","title":"现代 CNN 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/convolutional-networks/modern-cnn-designs","wordCount":991,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"现代-cnn-设计\">现代 CNN 设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>经典 CNN 架构主要依赖人工设计，而现代 CNN 设计融合了自动搜索、缩放策略和注意力机制等新思想。从 EfficientNet 的复合缩放到 ConvNeXt 对纯卷积设计的重新审视，现代 CNN 在精度和效率之间找到了更优的平衡点。这些设计不仅提升了模型性能，更改变了我们思考网络架构的方式。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;手工设计&lt;br/&gt;VGG/ResNet&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;自动搜索&lt;br/&gt;NAS/EfficientNet&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;缩放策略&lt;br/&gt;复合缩放&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;注意力增强&lt;br/&gt;SE/CBAM&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;重新审视&lt;br/&gt;ConvNeXt&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;现代 CNN&lt;br/&gt;兼具效率与精度&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"手工设计&lt;br/&gt;VGG/ResNet\"] --&gt; B[\"自动搜索&lt;br/&gt;NAS/EfficientNet\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"缩放策略&lt;br/&gt;复合缩放\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"注意力增强&lt;br/&gt;SE/CBAM\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"重新审视&lt;br/&gt;ConvNeXt\"]\n    C --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[\"现代 CNN&lt;br/&gt;兼具效率与精度\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>架构</th>\n<th>年份</th>\n<th>Top-1 精度</th>\n<th>参数量</th>\n<th>FLOPs</th>\n<th>核心特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ResNet-50</td>\n<td>2015</td>\n<td>76.1%</td>\n<td>25.6M</td>\n<td>4.1G</td>\n<td>残差连接基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SE-ResNet-50</td>\n<td>2018</td>\n<td>77.6%</td>\n<td>28.1M</td>\n<td>4.1G</td>\n<td>通道注意力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EfficientNet-B0</td>\n<td>2019</td>\n<td>77.1%</td>\n<td>5.3M</td>\n<td>0.39G</td>\n<td>NAS + 复合缩放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EfficientNet-B7</td>\n<td>2019</td>\n<td>84.3%</td>\n<td>66M</td>\n<td>37G</td>\n<td>最大缩放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ConvNeXt-T</td>\n<td>2022</td>\n<td>82.1%</td>\n<td>28.6M</td>\n<td>4.5G</td>\n<td>现代化纯卷积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ConvNeXt-L</td>\n<td>2022</td>\n<td>84.3%</td>\n<td>198M</td>\n<td>34.4G</td>\n<td>对标 Swin-L</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"通道注意力与-se-模块\">通道注意力与 SE 模块</h2><p>SE（Squeeze-and-Excitation）模块通过显式建模通道间的依赖关系来增强特征表示。它的核心思想是&quot;让网络学会关注重要的通道&quot;：先通过全局平均池化将每个通道压缩为一个标量（Squeeze），再通过两层全连接网络学习通道间的非线性关系（Excitation），最后用学到的权重重新校准通道响应。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class SEModule(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, channels, reduction=16):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.squeeze = nn.AdaptiveAvgPool2d(1)&#10;        self.excitation = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Linear(channels, channels // reduction, bias=False),&#10;            nn.ReLU(inplace=True),&#10;            nn.Linear(channels // reduction, channels, bias=False),&#10;            nn.Sigmoid(),&#10;        )&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        b, c, _, _ = x.size()&#10;        y = self.squeeze(x).view(b, c)&#10;        y = self.excitation(y).view(b, c, 1, 1)&#10;        return x * y.expand_as(x)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SEModule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, channels, reduction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.squeeze </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.AdaptiveAvgPool2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.excitation </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(channels, channels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reduction, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bias</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">inplace</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(channels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reduction, channels, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bias</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Sigmoid(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        b, c, _, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x.size()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.squeeze(x).view(b, c)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.excitation(y).view(b, c, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y.expand_as(x)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CBAM（Convolutional Block Attention Module）在 SE 的通道注意力基础上增加了空间注意力。通道注意力回答&quot;关注什么特征&quot;，空间注意力回答&quot;关注什么位置&quot;，两者协同工作进一步提升特征质量。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>注意力类型</th>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>核心操作</th>\n<th>额外参数</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>通道注意力</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>全局池化 + FC</td>\n<td>少</td>\n<td>SE, ECA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间注意力</td>\n<td>H×W</td>\n<td>通道池化 + 卷积</td>\n<td>极少</td>\n<td>CBAM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合注意力</td>\n<td>C×H×W</td>\n<td>通道 + 空间</td>\n<td>少</td>\n<td>CBAM</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"efficientnet-与复合缩放\">EfficientNet 与复合缩放</h2><p>EfficientNet 的核心贡献是<strong>复合缩放</strong>（Compound Scaling）策略。传统做法是单独增加网络的深度、宽度或分辨率来提升性能，但 EfficientNet 证明同时按比例缩放三者效果更好。</p>\n<p>具体来说，使用一个复合系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span> 统一控制三个维度的缩放：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>深度：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>α</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = \\alpha^\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>宽度：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w = \\beta^\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>分辨率：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>γ</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = \\gamma^\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>约束条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\cdot \\beta^2 \\cdot \\gamma^2 \\approx 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>，确保 FLOPs 大约增长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>ϕ</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 倍。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class MBConvBlock(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, in_ch, out_ch, expand_ratio, kernel_size, stride, se_ratio=0.25):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        mid_ch = in_ch * expand_ratio&#10;        self.expand = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv2d(in_ch, mid_ch, 1, bias=False),&#10;            nn.BatchNorm2d(mid_ch),&#10;            nn.SiLU(inplace=True),&#10;        ) if expand_ratio != 1 else nn.Identity()&#10;        self.depthwise = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv2d(mid_ch, mid_ch, kernel_size, stride=stride,&#10;                      padding=kernel_size // 2, groups=mid_ch, bias=False),&#10;            nn.BatchNorm2d(mid_ch),&#10;            nn.SiLU(inplace=True),&#10;        )&#10;        self.se = SEModule(mid_ch, reduction=int(1 / se_ratio))&#10;        self.project = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv2d(mid_ch, out_ch, 1, bias=False),&#10;            nn.BatchNorm2d(out_ch),&#10;        )&#10;        self.use_residual = (stride == 1 and in_ch == out_ch)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        residual = x&#10;        x = self.expand(x)&#10;        x = self.depthwise(x)&#10;        x = self.se(x)&#10;        x = self.project(x)&#10;        if self.use_residual:&#10;            x = x + residual&#10;        return x\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MBConvBlock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, in_ch, out_ch, expand_ratio, kernel_size, stride, se_ratio</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        mid_ch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> in_ch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expand_ratio</span></